ent-BarSignTheCoderbus = Coderbus | The Coderbus
    .desc = 一家極具爭議的酒吧，以種類繁多且不斷更新的飲品而聞名。 | A very controversial bar known for its wide variety of constantly-changing drinks.
ent-BarSignTheDrunkCarp = 《醉鯉》 | The Drunk Carp
    .desc = 切勿邊喝酒邊游泳。 | Don't drink and swim.
ent-BarSignEngineChange = 引擎更換 | The Engine Change
