ent-BarSignTheLooseGoose = 《漫步天鵝》 | The Loose Goose
    .desc = 喝到吐，和／或打破現實的法則！ | Drink till you puke and/or break the laws of reality!
ent-BarSignTheNet = 網路 | The Net
    .desc = 你似乎會不知不覺地沉浸其中好幾個小時。 | You just seem to get caught up in it for hours.
ent-BarSignTheOuterSpess = 《外層斯佩斯》 | The Outer Spess
