ent-BarSignWhiskeyEchoes = 威士忌的迴響 | Whiskey Echoes
    .desc = 這是一家專為精英人士設立的酒吧——等等，這其實是 NanoTrasen 站。為什麼資料庫裡會有這個標誌？ | An elite bar for elite oper-wait, this is a Nanotrasen station. Why's this sign in the database?
ent-BarSignEmped = 出現故障的酒吧招牌 | glitchy bar sign
    .desc = 你心想，狠狠打一巴掌或許就能解決問題。 | You imagine a good smack might fix it.
